WEBVTT

00:06:59.756 --> 00:07:02.436
And what I received from her message was,

00:07:02.476 --> 00:07:04.156
no matter our culture,

00:07:04.196 --> 00:07:07.836
color or how we identify,

00:07:07.876 --> 00:07:09.996
spirit is what we share.

00:07:09.996 --> 00:07:11.756
It's what connects us.

00:07:12.716 --> 00:07:15.396
You see, if we indigenize beauty,

00:07:15.436 --> 00:07:19.316
the meaning is transformed
from aesthetically pleasing

00:07:19.316 --> 00:07:21.836
to a state of divinity;

00:07:21.876 --> 00:07:25.676
beauty now becomes spirit manifested.

00:07:26.516 --> 00:07:29.636
Not only is spirit found within us,

00:07:29.676 --> 00:07:31.596
it's in all things.